   1.  In Lojban, why is the first argument of a predicate put before that
   predicate?  ... Shouldn't the predicate be first, and then its
   arguments?

You are not limited to one or the other arrangement.  You have a
choice.  You can put the selbri at the end or at the beginning or
elsewhere, and scramble the order of the sumti.

To use the canonical example:

        mi la bastn. la .atlantas. le dargu le karce cu klama
         I to-Boston from-Atlanta via-the road using-the car, go.

        klama fa mi la bastn. la .atlantas. le dargu le karce
          go,  I to-Boston from-Atlanta via-the road using-the car

